WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
PD uses the lining inside your belly to help remove waste and extra fluid from your blood.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
The cycler moves dialysis fluid. Your blood stays inside your body.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Fresh fluid goes in, stays for a prescribed time, then drains out with waste and extra water.

4
00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
APD often runs overnight at home. Treatment is usually daily; some people need a daytime exchange too.

5
00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Clinic reviews, supplies, storage, electricity and a daily care routine are still needed.

6
00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
PD is not suitable for everyone. Infection and discomfort can occur. RYNOR’s system is still in development.

